WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.790
2006.

2
00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:06.760
A best-selling book by Richard Dawkins
calls belief in God a delusion.

3
00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:10.390
Meanwhile, a Muslim student
chooses what to wear to lectures,

4
00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:12.980
and how to keep the fast in Ramadan.

5
00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:15.590
Lunch in the canteen
brings another question:

6
00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:17.370
is the meat halal?

7
00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:22.310
So how do Muslims keep their faith in a
society that treats religion as private,

8
00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:23.850
or as nonsense?

9
00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:28.700
In this mission, you'll name the pressures
that a secular society puts on faith.

10
00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:33.470
Then you'll weigh whether Muslims in Britain
can keep their identity without separating

11
00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:34.900
from society.

12
00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:39.780
Your mission: find out how Muslims keep
their faith alive when society pushes

13
00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:40.670
it aside.
